@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Register (HARUS SUKSES 201/200)
POST {{host}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tester LiftLog",
  "email": "tester@liftlog.test",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "password_confirmation": "rahasia123"
}

### 2. Login (Simpan token ke variabel)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@liftlog.test",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}


## 3. GET /api/profile (HARUS 401 tanpa token)
GET {{host}}/api/profile